{"id":"24edea3e3589ffa1","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map.md","title":"Definition — 预层映射的覆盖局部满性","display":"Definition — 预层映射的覆盖局部满性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map","aliases":["14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map"],"display":"Definition — 预层映射的覆盖局部满性","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]"],"source_ref":"III.7, paragraph preceding Corollary 6, printed p.144; DjVu image 78","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 预层映射的覆盖局部满性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"III.7, paragraph preceding Corollary 6, printed p.144; DjVu image 78"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span> 为预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi:P\\to Q\">\\(\\phi:P\\to Q\\)</span> 为自然变换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_C\">\\(\\phi_C\\)</span> 为其有类型分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocSurj}_J\">\\(\\operatorname{LocSurj}_J\\)</span> 为下式定义的谓词，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span> 已为层；覆盖是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(C)\">\\(J(C)\\)</span> 中的筛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocSurj}_J(\\phi,P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall y\\in Q(C)\\ \\exists R\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in R\\ \\exists x\\in P(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\ \n\\bigl(\\phi_{\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)}(x)=Q(f)(y)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LocSurj}_J(\\phi,P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall y\\in Q(C)\\ \\exists R\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in R\\ \\exists x\\in P(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\ \n\\bigl(\\phi_{\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)}(x)=Q(f)(y)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>III.7印刷144页在 Corollary 6 前明确将局部满性推广到任意预层映射。这里单列谓词，因为<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93ae791420c1822a\" href=\"?note=93ae791420c1822a\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective\">14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective</a>只陈述层之间的判据；两者在层输入上完全相同。公式是逐箭头的存在，不预设在整个覆盖筛上选择一族相容原像。空筛可覆盖时，该对象处的局部条件真是空条件，不应额外要求逐点满射。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective","status":"resolved","id":"93ae791420c1822a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"III.7印刷144页在 Corollary 6 前明确将局部满性推广到任意预层映射。这里单列谓词，因为[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]只陈述层之间的判据；两者在层输入上完全相同。公式是逐箭头的存在，不预设在整个覆盖筛上选择一族相容原像。空筛可覆盖时，该对象处的局部条件真是空条件，不应额外要求逐点满射。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi:P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocSurj}_J","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q","display":false},{"tex":"J(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocSurj}_J(\\phi,P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall y\\in Q(C)\\ \\exists R\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in R\\ \\exists x\\in P(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\ \n\\bigl(\\phi_{\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)}(x)=Q(f)(y)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1572,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map|df-271 — 预层映射的覆盖局部满性]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map|df-271 — 预层映射的覆盖局部满性]]"},{"id":"f606cb323c0490fd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$P,Q$ 为预层，$\\phi:P\\to Q$ 为自然变换。$(a,\\eta)$ 是[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]的层化函子及单位。$\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)}$ 是[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]在层范畴中的消去谓词；$\\operatorname{LocSurj}_J$ 见[[14-df-locally-surjective-presheaf-map]]，闭筛层 $\\Omega_J$ 及 $t_J$ 见[[14-df-closed-sieve-presheaf]]–[[14-thm-closed-sieve-classifier]]。"}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","1bdaf4a293143165","3fcbbf29a7947555","93ae791420c1822a"]}